---
interface Props { lessonId?: string }
const { lessonId } = Astro.props;
const roadmap = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}roadmap/`;
---

<section class="learning-progress" data-progress data-lesson={lessonId} data-pagefind-ignore aria-labelledby="learning-progress-title">
  <h2 id="learning-progress-title">{lessonId ? '本课学习进度' : '我的学习进度'}</h2>
  <p>进度保存在当前浏览器。换设备前可导出备份，再到另一台设备导入。</p>
  <div data-progress-controls hidden>
    <p data-progress-summary></p>
    <progress data-progress-meter max="48" value="0" aria-label="48 课完成进度"></progress>
    <div class="progress-actions">
      {lessonId && <button type="button" data-progress-toggle aria-pressed="false">标记完成</button>}
      {lessonId && <a href={roadmap}>查看学习路线</a>}
      {!lessonId && <>
        <button type="button" data-progress-export>导出进度</button>
        <button type="button" data-progress-import>导入进度</button>
        <input data-progress-file type="file" accept="application/json,.json" aria-label="选择进度 JSON 文件" hidden />
      </>}
      <button type="button" data-progress-restore hidden>从本地备份恢复</button>
      <button type="button" data-progress-restart hidden>重新开始</button>
    </div>
    {!lessonId && <p class="progress-note">导入会合并已完成的课程。需要重新学习时，可在对应课页撤销完成标记。</p>}
    <p data-progress-message role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>
  <noscript><p>启用 JavaScript 后可记录学习进度；课程正文和练习可以继续阅读。</p></noscript>
</section>

<script>
  import '../scripts/learning-progress.mjs';
</script>

<style>
  .learning-progress {
    margin-block: 2rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline-light);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-bg-nav);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  h2 { margin: 0; font-size: var(--sl-text-h3); line-height: 1.4; }
  p { margin-block: 0.75rem; }
  [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  progress { width: 100%; height: 0.75rem; accent-color: var(--sl-color-text-accent); }
  .progress-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  button, a { font: inherit; }
  button {
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-bg);
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  button:hover { border-color: var(--sl-color-text-accent); }
  button:focus-visible, a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--sl-color-text-accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
  button:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: not-allowed; }
  [data-progress-toggle][aria-pressed='true'] { border-color: var(--sl-color-text-accent); background: var(--sl-color-accent-low); }
  .progress-note { font-size: var(--sl-text-sm); }
  [data-progress-message]:empty { display: none; }
  [data-progress-message][data-error] { color: var(--sl-color-orange-high); }
</style>
